	quest.2C29043A5040D440.quest_desc: ["This modpack is a passion project and worked on in my spare time away from uni. Suggestions are always welcome. I need ideas for quest rewards and such. Thanks to all who enjoy."]
	quest.2D70579777D2B5F3.quest_desc: ["Same to how you can place shafts through a balloon envelope. Now you can do the same with pipes."]
