	quest.331859F01011B36D.quest_desc: ["Power grid is just hard and annoying, go ham."]
	quest.3427139387BDA309.quest_desc: ["Advancements just look so much better to get! Got one you don't know? Click it in the chat! The advancement menu is better than before!"]
	quest.342FC7980B12A67B.quest_desc: ["Set up your maps and minimap (Minimap off by default). See your creations move on the map! You can now designate areas with names by pressing R in the map."]
